 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Danjon Haishinsha o Sukutte Dai Bazurishita Tenshou Onmyoushi, Ukkari Choukyuu Jubutsu o Haishin Shitara Densetsu ni Natta"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "ダンジョン配信者を救って大バズりした転生陰陽師、うっかり超級呪物を配信したら伝説になった"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Reincarnated Onmyoji Who Went Viral After Saving a Dungeon Streamer"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Sora Ueno, a high school student reincarnated from the Heian era, is trying to make it big in the world of dungeon streaming. But there's just one problem — Onmyoji are seen as nothing more than shady frauds in this day and age, and his streams are stuck at a depressing zero viewers!\n\nEverything changes when Sora saves a massively popular, gorgeous streamer during a live broadcast. The clip goes insanely viral, and overnight, Sora finds himself in the spotlight. \n\nBut the real shocker? His Onmyoji powers aren't just real — they're so ridiculously overpowered that they blow everyone's expectations out of the water!",
   "ja": "平安時代から転生した高校生・上野ソラ。現代のダンジョン配信では陰陽師は胡散臭い存在で、ソラの配信は同時接続数ゼロだ。\n\nある日、ソラが超有名美少女配信者を助けたところ万バズで一躍有名人に！しかも陰陽術を駆使するソラの戦闘力は規格外すぎることが発覚…！\n\n最強陰陽師・ソラの万バズ連発なダンジョン配信ライフがスタートです!"
  },
